From 1a553ea0122712cde3563f4f5aa97613f18d91b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: obig20 <obig20@example.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:35:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/18] Render and play Room 3: movers in Level and Game, plus
 a timing-window bot test

Level builds and slides mover meshes (dark movers use the hidden-platform look); Game keeps
a simulation clock, applies carry/push-out each physics step, and lights dark movers with the
same lantern rule. tests/helpers/room3Sim.ts is a bot that tries every start moment in a
mover's cycle; each hop must succeed from at least 25% of them. M2 phase set to 1 from that data.

Co-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
